# ClaPDF Android Viewer

ClaPDF is an Android document viewer based on MuPDF. It supports viewing PDF
and other document formats; annotation editing and form filling are not
included.

The project builds a reusable viewer library and the ClaPDF Android
application. Documents can be opened from the app's file picker or shared with
the app from another application.

The reader opens in MuPDF's original horizontal continuous scrolling mode.
Other horizontal and vertical scrolling modes can be selected from the reader
toolbar. Long-press selectable text to bring up Android's standard floating
selection toolbar and copy the selected text.

